```

Khi bấm lưu:

```806:819:0.WINFORM/StudentManager/StudentCollection/frmStudentCollectionDetail.cs
if (lblKQRL6.Visible)
{
    itemStudentCollectionEditing.EthicLevel1 = cbxEthicLevel1.Text;
    itemStudentCollectionEditing.EthicLevel2 = cbxEthicLevel2.Text;
